        "payload": "tree 4c733a7bfc8481d66f433e200fbe5354b4eaae2b\nparent 28a108e8c085f7364c436f985153d11c338fb3fe\nauthor Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1779312069 -0500\ncommitter Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1779312069 -0500\n\nShow per-recipient share for multi-recipient on-chain zap notifications\n\nA kind 8333 batch zap's `amount` tag is the total paid across all\nrecipients (per NIP.md). The notification renderer was displaying that\ntotal to every recipient verbatim, so a $250 zap-all sent to 471\npeople showed up in each recipient's inbox as \"Alex Gleason zapped\nyou $250\".\n\nSplit the total evenly across the listed `p` recipients and label the\nzap with \"and N others\" so the source of the share is clear. The even\nsplit is exact for Ditto-produced batches (useOnchainZapMany always\npays an equal amount per recipient) and a reasonable approximation\nfor batches from other clients — verifying the per-recipient share\nagainst the on-chain tx is async and too expensive for a notification\ncard.\n\nRegression-of: 17f0055a (Add 'Zap all members' on-chain action to people-list events)\n",
